---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About Us — Shri Kundali">
  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 0">
    <h1 style="color:#8b4513;margin-bottom:1.5rem">About Shri Kundali</h1>

    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Shri Kundali is a Vedic astrology platform that provides personalized birth chart analysis and financial guidance based on ancient Jyotish principles.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Our Mission</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      To make authentic Vedic astrology accessible to everyone through technology. We combine traditional Jyotish wisdom with modern tools to deliver accurate, personalized insights that help people make better life decisions.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">How It Works</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Our platform uses the Prokerala astrology API to calculate accurate birth charts based on Lahiri ayanamsa. Charts are analyzed using traditional Vedic principles to generate personalized reports covering career, finance, relationships, and life path.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color:#8b4513;font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Privacy First</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
      Your birth details are sensitive personal information. We treat them with the utmost care, store them securely, and never share them with third parties. Your privacy is our priority.
    </p>

    <p style="color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid #f0e6d6;padding-top:1rem">
      © 2026 Shri Kundali. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
